<div>
<b>Your portable clinic</b>
<p>
One photo in daylight is enough to start. We check the light, the framing
and how much skin we can see before we read anything — and we ask for
another photo instead of guessing.
</p>
</div>
<div>
<b>Scan, learn, transform</b>
<p>
Your readings settle into a profile you can correct. If we got your skin
wrong, you tell us, and it changes. Every recommendation carries the
ingredient that caused it.
</p>
